---
description: Security and PR hygiene for changes in this repo
alwaysApply: true
---
No secrets in code, rules, skills, or tickets.
Prefer explicit diffs a human can review; avoid drive-by renames.
Do not disable CI, lint, or tests to make a change pass.
If you are unsure about security or data handling, stop and ask.
Keep PRs scoped to the ticket acceptance criteria.
